#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:3 077be7d946254d28884ba62288f87669
msgid "MAVExplorer"
msgstr "MAVExplorer"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:5 a94007a25521472a949fadcc79b5dd4f
msgid ""
"The MAVExplorer tool is an interactive tool for graphing APM logfiles (tlogs"
" or dataflash logs)."
msgstr "MAVExplorer 是一款用于绘制 APM 日志文件（tlog 或 dataflash 日志）图表的交互式工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:7 e72f3864f46d4bdaad653264dd5aaccd
msgid "Under Linux, it can be accessed by:"
msgstr "在 Linux 下，可通过以下方式访问："

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:13 d827edbf77c341d99f9302afa469674a
msgid ""
"Under Windows, it can be found in the Start Menu with the rest of MAVProxy."
msgstr "在 Windows 下，可在开始菜单中与其他 MAVProxy 工具一起找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:15 90cecacb7d4a487a949b68e0f6d3a303
msgid ""
"Use the MAVExplorer->Open menu to open tlog or dataflash files to graph."
msgstr "使用 MAVExplorer->Open 菜单打开 tlog 或 dataflash 文件以绘制图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:19 df1cc9a8c1344e0e8da6e3acda06465d
msgid ""
"The Graphs menu will automatically populate based upon the available packets"
" in the logfile."
msgstr "Graphs 菜单将根据日志文件中的可用数据包自动填充。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:21 633bc63624854993b4d81a0da1e7d971
msgid ""
"To narrow down the log file to a particular phase of the logfile, select the"
" relevant mode from the FlightMode menu. Any future graphs will only cover "
"the selected section of the flight."
msgstr "若要将日志文件缩小到特定飞行阶段，请从 FlightMode 菜单中选择相应模式。此后生成的任何图表都将只覆盖所选的飞行阶段。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:25 7d20d7d5648942ddb8994f080adab1db
msgid ""
"The Display menu contains methods for displaying a map of the GPS points of "
"the logfile and reloading the logfile. Additionally there are methods for "
"creating and saving custom graphs, using the same notation as with the "
":ref:`graph <mavproxy-modulegraph>` module in MAVProxy."
msgstr ""
"Display 菜单包含用于显示日志文件 GPS 点地图和重新加载日志文件的方法。此外，还提供了创建和保存自定义图表的方法，使用与 MAVProxy 中"
" :ref:`graph <mavproxy-modulegraph>` 模块相同的符号表示法。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:29 c54aabea8e6540dba5ea62ea96ca93d9
msgid "Saving custom graphs is not currently available on Windows."
msgstr "保存自定义图表功能目前在 Windows 上不可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavexp.rst:31 2b9d3622732c4b0e937cd35d4dfe9b8c
msgid ""
"More information about this program can be found in the `ArduPilot "
"documentation <http://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-"
"analysis.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"有关该程序的更多信息，请参阅 `ArduPilot 文档 <http://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/using-"
"mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.html>`_。"
